      *       (C) Copyright Progressive Data Solutions, Inc., 1997         *
      *  AFTWMCHPO: Conversion query for new WMCHP                         *
      **********************************************************************
      *  DESCRIPTION:                                                      *
      *  This query produces a record count on the new file.               *
      *                                                                    *
      *  CREATED: 12/17/97         PROGRAMMER: 84         PROJECT: 60ANY   *
      **********************************************************************
      *  REVISIONS:                                                        *
      *                                                                    *
      **********************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WMCHP)
     A          R PRTHDR                    SKIPB(2)           SPACEA(2)
     A            PTRDAT        10A        1
     A            PTTITL        50A       41
     A                                   125'Page'
     A            PTPAGE         4S 0    129                   EDTCDE(4)
     A            PTRTIM         8A        1SPACEB(1)          SPACEA(2)
     A                                     1'File:'
     A            PTQFIL        21A        7                   SPACEA(2)
     A                                     3'Company/Fund'
     A                                    +4'Year'
     A                                    +4'Stat'
     A                                    +8'Count'

      * Print totals on CHOCST break

     A          R PRTBK1                                       SPACEA(1)
     A            XXCO#     R              5REFFLD(CHCO#)      EDTCDE(3)
     A  61                                                     UNDERLINE
     A            XXFND     R             +4REFFLD(CHFND)      EDTCDE(3)
     A  61                                                     UNDERLINE
     A            XXFYR     R             +5REFFLD(CHFYR)      EDTCDE(3)
     A  61                                                     UNDERLINE
     A            XXOCST    R             +6REFFLD(CHOCST)
     A            XXCOUNT1       9S 0     +5                   EDTCDE(3)
     A  61                                                     UNDERLINE

      * Print totals on CHFYR break

     A          R PRTBK2                                       SPACEA(1)
     A                                     1'*'
     A            XXCO#     R              5REFFLD(CHCO#)      EDTCDE(3)
     A            XXFND     R             +4REFFLD(CHFND)      EDTCDE(3)
     A            XXFYR     R             +5REFFLD(CHFYR)      EDTCDE(3)
     A            XXCOUNT2       9S 0    +12                   EDTCDE(3)

      * Print totals on CHCO#/CHFND break

     A          R PRTBK3                                       SPACEA(1)
     A                                     1'**'
     A            XXCO#     R              5REFFLD(CHCO#)      EDTCDE(3)
     A            XXFND     R             +4REFFLD(CHFND)      EDTCDE(3)
     A            XXCOUNT3       9S 0    +20                   EDTCDE(3)

      * Print grand totals

     A          R PRTTOT                                       SPACEA(1)
     A                                     1'Grand totals:'
     A            XXCOUNT        9S 0    +21                   EDTCDE(3)

      * Print a blank line

     A          R PRTBLK                                       SPACEA(1)
     A                                     1' '
